{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10371","headline":"登百丈峰二首 一 · 高适","name":"登百丈峰二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝登百丈峰，遥望燕支道。\n汉垒青冥间，胡天白如扫。\n忆昔霍将军，连年此征讨。\n匈奴终不灭，寒山徒草草。\n唯见鸿雁飞，令人伤怀抱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}